  image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 1d9375e96f263504f8b679fc78f52365, type: 3}
  eventDescription: "A ghostly archmage shows reveal themselves to you. They claim
    to be the greatest archmage to have ever existed, and could have taken over the
    world if they didn't try harnessing the power of the Skyshard for themselves.
    To prove their claim, they offer to train you in one of the four elemental magic,
    these are...\t\t"
